transform=\"scale(0.015625)\"/></defs><use xlink:href=\"#LibreFranklin-Regular-dd\"/></g></g></g><g id=\"patch_3\"><path d=\"M 62.98533 133.056 L 202.767148 133.056 L 202.767148 79.180182 L 62.98533 79.180182 z\n\" clip-path=\"url(#p7980976864)\" style=\"fill: #0a8f9c\"/></g><g id=\"patch_4\"><path d=\"M 237.712602 133.056 L 377.49442 133.056 L 377.49442 16.896 L 237.712602 16.896 z\n\" clip-path=\"url(#p7980976864)\" style=\"fill: #c2410c\"/></g><g id=\"patch_5\"><path d=\"M 47.259875 133.056 L 47.259875 11.088 \" style=\"fill: none; stroke: #cccccc; stroke-width: 0.8; stroke-linejoin: miter; stroke-linecap: square\"/></g><g id=\"patch_6\"><path d=\"M 47.259875 133.056 L 393.219875 133.056 \" style=\"fill: none; stroke: #cccccc; stroke-width: 0.8; stroke-linejoin: miter; stroke-linecap: square\"/></g><g id=\"text_8\"><g style=\"fill: #333333\" transform=\"translate(126.056239 77.212182) scale(0.08 -0.08)\"><defs><path id=\"LibreFranklin-Regular-87\" d=\"M 3456 4749 Q 3507 4749 3532 4723 Q 3558 4698 3552 4672 L 3546 4442 Q 3546 4390 3520 4329 Q 3494 4269 3456 4211 Q 3200 3827 2960 3385 Q 2720 2944 2515 2477 Q 2310 2010 2147 1571 Q 1984 1133 1875 758 Q 1766 384 1728 122 Q 1715 0 1632 0 L 1126 0 Q 1024 0 1050 109 Q 1139 467 1289 918 Q 1440 1370 1661 1891 Q 1882 2413 2182 2982 Q 2483 3552 2861 4147 Q 2886 4186 2880 4211 Q 2874 4237 2816 4237 L 339 4237 Q 262 4237 262 4314 L 307 4685 Q 314 4749 403 4749 L 3456 4749 z\n\" transform=\"scale(0.015625)\"/></defs><use xlink:href=\"#LibreFranklin-Regular-81\"/><use xlink:href=\"#LibreFranklin-Regular-87\" transform=\"translate(46.5 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#LibreFranklin-Regular-83\" transform=\"translate(106.40625 0)\"/></g></g><g id=\"text_9\"><g style=\"fill: #333333\" transform=\"translate(300.079761 14.928) scale(0.08 -0.08)\"><use xlink:href=\"#LibreFranklin-Regular-83\"/><use xlink:href=\"#LibreFranklin-Regular-87\" transform=\"translate(64.09375 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#LibreFranklin-Regular-83\" transform=\"translate(124 0)\"/></g></g></g></g><defs><clipPath id=\"p7980976864\"><rect x=\"47.259875\" y=\"11.088\" width=\"345.96\" height=\"121.968\"/></clipPath></defs></svg>\n","title":"Exhibit 1 · Three-year profit per learner or seat ($)","note":null},"answer":"<p>Employer seat: year 1 $135; year 2: 70% renew × ($250 − $40 − $10) = $140; year 3: 49% × $200 = $98. Total <b>$373</b>.</p> <p>Individual: $140 + 10% buy again × ($400 − $40 − $30) = <b>$173</b>.</p> <p><b>So-what:</b> over three years an employer seat earns 2.2× as much, because renewals don't need new marketing.</p>"},{"q":"What would it take to make the employer route work?","exhibit":null,"answer":"<ul><li><b>A small sales team</b> targeting HR and learning heads at mid-sized firms</li><li><b>Employer features:</b> progress reports, cohort scheduling, invoicing</li> <li><b>Proof of results:</b> completion rates and skills tests, since employers buy outcomes</li><li>Check the 70% renewal assumption with a pilot of 10 employers</li></ul>"}],"reco":"Build the employer route. A seat earns about the same as an individual learner in year 1 ($135 vs $140), but because employers renew, a seat earns about $373 over three years against $173 for an individual, 2.2× as much. Start with a small sales team and the reporting features employers need, while keeping the individual business. Risk: the 70% renewal rate is borrowed from other providers. Next step: pilot with 10 employers and measure completion and renewal intent.","great":["Compares profit after the cost to win, not price","Looks beyond year 1 to renewals","Quantifies the three-year difference","Lists what the new channel needs to work"],"id":61,"slug":"vivid-career-courses"}